592186375923 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375923 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the curvature at an arbitrary point on the curve $r(t)$ given that its derivative ${r}^{′}(t)$ and the derivative of the corresponding unit tangent ${T}^{′}(t)$ are as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t)=⟨\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}{{e}^{t}},\\,-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}{{e}^{t}}⟩,\\,{T}^{′}(t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375923 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "fcaec574-ebde-5bb8-97c7-77da61871c71" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375923 #edb/ref 1074 "Since we are given both the derivative of the curve ${r}^{′}(t)$ and the derivative of the unit tangent ${T}^{′}(t)$, we will use the following formula for the curvature:\n\n$$\nκ(t)=\\frac{‖{T}^{′}(t)‖}{‖{r}^{′}(t)‖}\n$$\n\nNow, we find the magnitudes of ${r}^{′}(t)$ and ${T}^{′}(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖{T}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{{(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)}^{2}+{(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{{sin}^{2}⁡t+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t+{sin}^{2}⁡t-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{2({sin}^{2}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t)} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{2} \\\\  & =1 \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}{{e}^{t}})}^{2}+{(-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}{{e}^{t}})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡t-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{sin}^{2}⁡t}{{e}^{2t}}+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡t+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t}{{e}^{2t}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{e}^{t}}\\cdot \\sqrt{2({sin}^{2}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t)} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{{e}^{t}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the curvature is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}κ(t) & =\\frac{‖{T}^{′}(t)‖}{‖{r}^{′}(t)‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{{e}^{t}})} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{t}}{\\sqrt{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375924 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375925 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375924 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375926 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375924 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375927 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375924 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375928 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375924 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375929 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375924 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375924 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375924 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186375925 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375924 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "4d564c3b-bc44-527d-b38b-8c6df86c4124" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375925 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{{e}^{t}}{\\sqrt{2}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375925 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375925 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "6da15c27-0ab0-56cd-8ef3-27f8c1c55a7b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375926 #edb/ref 1080 "2{e}^{t}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375926 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375926 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5fd2612d-5711-599a-a694-c2afac45f762" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375927 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{{e}^{t}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375927 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375927 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c63764c7-24ed-559f-b365-20b4780612bf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375928 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{{e}^{t}}{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375928 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375928 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a55dd6d8-17f7-5ead-b3ba-94f6823a5462" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186375929 #edb/r